{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached or visible, move and grab it. Check if good, then perform task. Avoid obstacles. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Sequence>     <Action ID = PickUpObject    />     <Condition ID = IsTargetReached    />     <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    />",
